Package: neofetch-c
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fast system information tool with ASCII art
 Neofetch-C is a fast reimplementation of the neofetch system information
 utility in C. It displays key system details alongside colorful ASCII art
 logos for your distribution, optimized for speed and low resource usage.
